 ["redux 调用的两个模型现阶段最好选择512版本的 512的整体质量无疑是高于384的\nclip视觉编码的裁剪请选none\n\n此组默认可以bypass忽略，以提高生图速度，待需要生成高清图，再固定种子，开启此组。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [210, 165.3921356201172], "pos": [1709.311279296875, -12.618444442749023], "id": 525, "properties": {}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["Instructions:\n\n1. Upload an image  \n2. Configure the large model (fill, icedit lora, clip l, t5xxl, ae)  \n3. Enter editing instructions (e.g., \"change her clothes to yellow, the skirt to black, and add glasses\"), then generate the image  \n4. Provided the initial generated image is acceptable, fix the seed and proceed with image upscaling  \n\nThe core of this workflow lies in the ICEdit lora, an extended lora based on the iclora framework. The original iclora paper mentioned their intention to develop instruction-based image editing; however, it appears they are now focusing heavily on video-related VACE projects, leaving this direction to be further developed and released by another team. Currently, the resolution of the initial images generated through this workflow is limited, and the editing process may unintentionally affect other regions of the image. Instruction control accuracy also requires further improvement. At this stage, it remains a prototype—yet the potential for precise image editing via complex instructions is already visible. As such, continuous improvements and updates to this workflow are expected.\n\nPaper title: In-Context Edit: Enabling Instructional Image Editing with In-Context Generation in Large Scale Diffusion Transformer  \nPaper link: https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.20690Project address: https://github.com/River-Zhang/ICEdit  \nOfficial ICEdit LoRA download link: https://huggingface.co/sanaka87/ICEdit-MoE-LoRA/tree/main  \nA modified ICEdit LoRA by user aha based on the official version: https://hf-mirror.com/aha2023/average_MOE_ICEdit-MoE-LoRA/tree/main  \n(User aha mentioned that certain layers from the official LoRA couldn't be loaded properly, so he fine-tuned the weights of four expert layers in the official LoRA. Testing today showed minimal differences between the two versions. You can download both and try them out—if generation doesn't work well with the original, give the fine-tuned LoRA a try.)  \nIf you encounter any issues during use, feel free to leave a message or join the QQ group (Group No.: 247228975) for free consultation."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "工作流说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [437.0279541015625, 384.252197265625], "pos": [-1997.7962646484375, -219.16061401367188], "id": 526, "properties": {}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image1", "links": [894], "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["Alibaba-PuHuiTi-Heavy.ttf", 40, 32, "light"], "inputs": [{"name": "reel_1", "link": 924, "label": "reel_1", "type": "Reel", "localized_name": "reel_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "reel_2", "link": 925, "label": "reel_2", "type": "Reel", "localized_name": "reel_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "reel_3", "label": "reel_3", "type": "Reel", "localized_name": "reel_3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "reel_4", "label": "reel_4", "type": "Reel", "localized_name": "reel_4"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LayerUtility: ImageReelComposit", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [277.20001220703125, 190], "pos": [489.5353088378906, -626.177001953125], "id": 459, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_layerstyle", "ver": "c0fb64d0ebcb81c6c445a8af79ecee24bc3845b0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: ImageReelComposit"}, "order": 55}, {"outputs": [{"name": "seed", "slot_index": 0, "links": [236, 237], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [799943622355286, "randomize", null], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "easy seed", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [210, 106], "pos": [